678\" name=\"phone\"/></div></div><div><label for=\"service\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium mb-2\">관심 서비스</label><select id=\"service\" name=\"service\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-black/50 border border-white/20 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-[#7CB342] transition-colors text-white\"><option value=\"\">서비스를 선택하세요</option><option value=\"dev\">SW/HW/FW 개발</option><option value=\"iot\">IoT 개발</option><option value=\"controll\">제어 솔루션</option><option value=\"consulting\">컨설팅</option><option value=\"other\">기타</option></select></div><div><label for=\"message\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium mb-2\">프로젝트 설명</label><textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"6\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-black/50 border border-white/20 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-[#7CB342] transition-colors text-white resize-none\" placeholder=\"프로젝트에 대해 자세히 설명해주세요\"></textarea></div><div class=\"flex justify-center pt-4\"><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive h-10 has-[&gt;svg]:px-4 bg-[#7CB342] hover:bg-[#689F38] text-white px-12 py-6 text-lg rounded-full\" type=\"submit\">상담 신청하기</button></div></form></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6\"><div class=\"container mx-auto max-w-6xl\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-12 tracking-wide\">CONTACT</h2><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><h3 class=\"text-sm text-white/50 mb-2 tracking-wider\">COMPANY NAME</h3><p class=\"text-lg\">보로닉스</p><p class=\"text-lg text-white/70\">boronix </p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm text-white/50 mb-2 tracking